   "subject": "Correct Model Specification",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Lavaan group -<div><br></div><div>I&#39;m trying to specify the model attached in the picture where Constituents Attitudes is the exogenous variable and all others are endogenous. The relationship between the exogenous variable Constituents Attitudes and Congressmen Perceptions is 1, which seems wrong. I have what I think is a correlation, but might be a covariance matrix:</div><div><br></div><div><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(6,26,153)\">library(<span style=\"color:#000000\">lavaan</span>)</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(6,26,153)\">library(<span style=\"color:#000000\">semPlot</span>)</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco\">lower<span style=\"color:#4f4f4f\"> </span><span style=\"color:#061a99\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#4f4f4f\"> </span><span style=\"color:#061a99\">matrix(c(</span><span style=\"color:#045218\">1</span><span style=\"color:#061a99\">,</span><span style=\"color:#4f4f4f\"> </span><span style=\"color:#c38809\">NA</span><span style=\"color:#061a99\">,</span><span style=\"color:#4f4f4f\"> </span><span style=\"color:#c38809\">NA</span><span style=\"color:#061a99\">,</span><span style=\"color:#4f4f4f\"> </span><span style=\"color:#c38809\">NA</span><span style=\"color:#061a99\">,</span><span style=\"color:#4f4f4f\"> </span>.475<span style=\"color:#061a99\">,</span><span style=\"color:#4f4f4f\"> </span><span style=\"color:#045218\">1</span><span style=\"color:#061a99\">,</span><span style=\"color:#4f4f4f\"> </span><span style=\"color:#c38809\">NA</span><span style=\"color:#061a99\">,</span><span style=\"color:#4f4f4f\"> </span><span style=\"color:#c38809\">NA</span><span style=\"color:#061a99\">,</span><span style=\"color:#4f4f4f\"> </span>.738<span style=\"color:#061a99\">,</span><span style=\"color:#4f4f4f\"> </span>.643<span style=\"color:#061a99\">,</span><span style=\"color:#4f4f4f\"> </span><span style=\"color:#045218\">1</span><span style=\"color:#061a99\">,</span><span style=\"color:#4f4f4f\"> </span><span style=\"color:#c38809\">NA</span><span style=\"color:#061a99\">,</span><span style=\"color:#4f4f4f\"> </span>.608<span style=\"color:#061a99\">,</span><span style=\"color:#4f4f4f\"> </span>.721<span style=\"color:#061a99\">,</span><span style=\"color:#4f4f4f\"> </span>.823<span style=\"color:#061a99\">,</span><span style=\"color:#4f4f4f\"> </span><span style=\"color:#045218\">1</span><span style=\"color:#061a99\">),</span><span style=\"color:#4f4f4f\"> </span><span style=\"color:#045218\">4</span><span style=\"color:#061a99\">,</span><span style=\"color:#4f4f4f\"> </span><span style=\"color:#045218\">4</span><span style=\"color:#061a99\">,</span><span style=\"color:#4f4f4f\"> </span>byrow<span style=\"color:#4f4f4f\"> </span><span style=\"color:#061a99\">=</span><span style=\"color:#4f4f4f\"> </span><span style=\"color:#c38809\">TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#061a99\">)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco\"><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(176,22,0)\"><span style=\"color:#061a99\">colnames(</span><span style=\"color:#000000\">lower</span><span style=\"color:#061a99\">)</span><span style=\"color:#4f4f4f\"> </span><span style=\"color:#061a99\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#4f4f4f\"> </span><span style=\"color:#061a99\">rownames(</span><span style=\"color:#000000\">lower</span><span style=\"color:#061a99\">)</span><span style=\"color:#4f4f4f\"> </span><span style=\"color:#061a99\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#4f4f4f\"> </span><span style=\"color:#061a99\">c(</span>&quot;consAtt&quot;<span style=\"color:#061a99\">,</span><span style=\"color:#4f4f4f\"> </span>&quot;congressAtt&quot;<span style=\"color:#061a99\">,</span><span style=\"color:#4f4f4f\"> </span>&quot;perceptions&quot;<span style=\"color:#061a99\">,</span><span style=\"color:#4f4f4f\"> </span>&quot;rollCallBehav&quot;<span style=\"color:#061a99\">)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(6,26,153)\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:18px;color:rgb(34,34,34)\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(6,26,153)\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:18px;color:rgb(34,34,34)\">mod1 </span><span style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:18px\">&lt;- </span><span style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:18px;color:rgb(176,22,0)\">&#39;</span><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(176,22,0)\"># latent vars</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(176,22,0)\">consAtt =~ perceptions </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(176,22,0);min-height:15px\"><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(176,22,0)\"># regressions</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(176,22,0)\">congressAtt ~ perceptions</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(176,22,0)\">rollCallBehav ~ perceptions + congressAtt</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(176,22,0)\">&#39;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(79,79,79);min-height:15px\"><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco\">mod1fit<span style=\"color:#b01600\"> </span><span style=\"color:#061a99\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#b01600\"> </span><span style=\"color:#061a99\">sem(</span>mod1<span style=\"color:#061a99\">,</span><span style=\"color:#b01600\"> </span>sample.cov<span style=\"color:#b01600\"> </span><span style=\"color:#061a99\">=</span><span style=\"color:#b01600\"> </span>lower<span style=\"color:#061a99\">,</span><span style=\"color:#b01600\"> </span>sample.nobs<span style=\"color:#b01600\"> </span><span style=\"color:#061a99\">=</span><span style=\"color:#b01600\"> </span><span style=\"color:#045218\">116</span><span style=\"color:#061a99\">)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(176,22,0);min-height:15px\"><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco\"><span style=\"color:#061a99\">semPaths(</span>mod1fit<span style=\"color:#061a99\">,</span><span style=\"color:#b01600\"> </span>what<span style=\"color:#b01600\"> </span><span style=\"color:#061a99\">=</span><span style=\"color:#b01600\"> &quot;est&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#061a99\">,</span><span style=\"color:#b01600\"> </span>layout<span style=\"color:#b01600\"> </span><span style=\"color:#061a99\">=</span><span style=\"color:#b01600\"> &quot;tree2&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#061a99\">,</span><span style=\"color:#b01600\"> </span>title<span style=\"color:#b01600\"> </span><span style=\"color:#061a99\">=</span><span style=\"color:#b01600\"> </span><span style=\"color:#c38809\">TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#061a99\">,</span><span style=\"color:#b01600\"> </span>style<span style=\"color:#b01600\"> </span><span style=\"color:#061a99\">=</span><span style=\"color:#b01600\"> &quot;LISREL&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#061a99\">,</span><span style=\"color:#b01600\"> </span>nCharNodes<span style=\"color:#b01600\"> </span><span style=\"color:#061a99\">=</span><span style=\"color:#b01600\"> </span><span style=\"color:#045218\">10</span><span style=\"color:#061a99\">)</span></p></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "XeOP5hMxn3YJ",
   "from": "Jeremy Miles",
   "author": "0325c6a976085eab",
   "date": "2014-04-30T17:52:53Z",
   "subject": "Re: Correct Model Specification",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hello Again,<div><br></div><div>You have no latent variables in your path diagram, so the latent variable section should be removed.</div><div><br>Then you need to add that regression to your model.</div><div>\r\n\r\n<br></div><div>This will do it:</div><div><div><br></div><div><div>mod1 &lt;- &#39;</div></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div><div># regressions</div><div>congressAtt ~ perceptions</div><div>rollCallBehav ~ perceptions + congressAtt</div></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div><div>perceptions ~ consAtt</div>\r\n\r\n<div>&#39;</div></div></div><div><br></div><div>Jeremy</div><div><br></div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
